</span><span begin="0:41.044" end="0:41.818">论</span></p><p begin="0:45.386" end="0:50.623" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:45.386" end="0:45.658">要</span><span begin="0:45.658" end="0:46.098">拼尽</span><span begin="0:46.098" end="0:46.490">所</span><span begin="0:46.490" end="0:47.058">有</span> <span begin="0:47.789" end="0:48.289">换得</span><span begin="0:48.289" end="0:49.263">普通</span><span begin="0:49.263" end="0:49.682">的</span><span begin="0:49.682" end="0:49.980">剧</span><span begin="0:49.980" end="0:50.623">本</span></p><p begin="0:52.323" end="0:56.703" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.323" end="0:53.314">曲折</span><span begin="0:53.314" end="0:53.840">辗</span><span begin="0:53.840" end="0:54.265">转</span> <span begin="0:54.265" end="0:54.559">不</span><span begin="0:54.559" end="0:54.909">过</span><span begin="0:55.249" end="0:55.526">谋</span><span begin="0:55.526" end="0:56.703">生</span></p><p begin="0:59.083" end="1:03.733" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:59.083" end="0:59.349">我</span><span begin="0:59.349" end="1:00.021">是</span><span begin="1:00.021" end="1:00.916">离开</span><span begin="1:00.916" end="1:01.403">小</span><span begin="1:01.403" end="1:01.688">镇</span><span begin="1:01.688" end="1:02.243">上</span><span begin="1:02.243" end="1:02.730">的</span><span begin="1:02.730" end="1:03.733">人</span></p><p begin="1:06.133" end="1:10.840" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:06.133" end="1:06.542">是</span><span begin="1:06.542" end="1:06.858">哭</span><span begin="1:06.858" end="1:07.606">笑</span><span begin="1:07.606" end="1:07.982">着</span><span begin="1:07.982" end="1:08.584">吃</span><span begin="1:08.584" end="1:08.834">过</span><span begin="1:08.834" end="1:09.533">饭</span><span begin="1:09.533" end="1:09.916">的</span><span begin="1:09.916" end="1:10.840">人</span></p><p begin="1:13.762" end="1:19.503" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.762" end="1:14.439">是赶</span><span begin="1:14.439" en